We have to make style inside the head inside style we need to give. instead of class we give element name like button, it will change all button in webpage to same font, instead that we create a class .subscribe-button apply to specific button.
Be cautious when we keep styling inside style , it may overright

On a class attribute we can give multiple class by give space like below
class="js-subscribe-button subscribe-button"

As we aware we can get the html element inside javascript and that element will become object.each obj will have property and method. On here another property called classList attribute which has method call add and remove , we can use classList property add method to add the class when we click the button like below aand remove the class as well.  eg below
const buttonElement = document.querySelector('.js-subscribe-button');
        if(buttonElement.innerHTML === 'Subscribe') {
          buttonElement.innerHTML = 'Subscribed';
          buttonElement.classList.add('is-subscribed');
        } else {
          buttonElement.innerHTML = 'Subscribe';
          buttonElement.classList.remove('is-subscribed');
        }

